​Day 6 & Day 7: Guerilla warfare & Survival Demonstrations
• ​Day 6: Return transit from Gangtok to SFF Camp, Rabongla.
•  ​Day 7: Field demonstrations on Guerilla Warfare and Survival Techniques: 
◦ ​HUMINT Operations: Briefing on Human Intelligence collection as a core operational responsibility.
◦ ​Survival Equipment Display: Demonstration of multipurpose gear including improvised torches, ice-breaker pens, pocket cutting chains, fire lighters, and tactical compasses.
